{
  "$comment": "The repository entries of a team's capture policy, as the account service stores them and as terma-cli reads them. Byte-identical copies: mirador-platform account/api/internal/policy/testdata/entry_grammar.json and terma-cli internal/routing/testdata/entry_grammar.json; change both together. server: the account service stores the entry (validatePolicyRepository, after trimming). cli: terma-cli's routing.ParseEntry with wildcards on reads it as exact, wildcard or refused. The CLI is the more lenient reader: it also takes clone URLs, which the server refuses. Contract, checked on both sides: an entry the server stores is never refused by the CLI, and the server's wildcard (a whole last /* segment) is the CLI's wildcard.",
  "cases": [
    {"entry": "github.com/acme/api", "server": true, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "GitHub.com/Owner/Repo.js", "server": true, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "gitlab.com/group/sub/app", "server": true, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "Localhost/a/b", "server": true, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "git.example.co.uk/Données/app", "server": true, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "github.com/Acme/*", "server": true, "cli": "wildcard"},
    {"entry": "gitlab.com/acme/platform/*", "server": true, "cli": "wildcard"},
    {"entry": "localhost/a/*", "server": true, "cli": "wildcard"},

    {"entry": "", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "a/b", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github.com/a", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github.com//b", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github.com/a/b/", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "https://github.com/a/b", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "github.com/a/b.git", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "github.com/a/b.GIT", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "Sales Reports", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github.com/a/b c", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "github.com/a/b\tc", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github/a/b", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "github.com:22/a/b", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "git@github.com/a/b", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},
    {"entry": "git@github.com:a/b", "server": false, "cli": "exact"},

    {"entry": "*", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github.com/*", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github.com/acme/terma-*", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
    {"entry": "github.com/*/api", "server": false, "cli": "refused"},
